<h2>Pending Approval Requires Your Attention</h2>
<p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
<p>You have a pending approval request that needs your attention.</p>
<div class="detail">
  <strong>Request from:</strong> {{requesterName}}<br>
  <strong>Type:</strong> {{requestType}}<br>
  <strong>Submitted:</strong> {{submittedDate}}
</div>
{{#if link}}
<p><a href="{{link}}" class="btn">Review Request</a></p>
{{/if}}
<p>Please review this request at your earliest convenience.</p>
